          "description": "وادٍ بالقرب من شاليم التقى فيه إبراهيم بملكي صادق (تكوين 14: 17)؛ ويُعرف أيضًا بعمق الملك.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "عمق شوى"
    },
    "bis": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Wan vali klosap long Salem we Ebraham i mitim Melkisedek long hem (Jenesis 14:17); we oli save long hem tu olsem Vali blong King.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Vali blong Sabe"
    },
    "eng": {
      "alternate_labels": [
        "Shaveh Valley",
        "Shaveh"
      ],
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "article": "place:ValleyOfShaveh",
          "description": "A valley near Salem where Abraham met Melchizedek (Genesis 14:17); also known as the King's Valley.",
          "gloss": "Valley of Shaveh",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Valley of Shaveh"
    },
    "fas": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "دره‌ای در نزدیکی شالیم که ابراهیم در آنجا با ملکِی‌صدق ملاقات کرد (پیدایش ۱۴: ۱۷)؛ همچنین معروف به دره پادشاه.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "دره شاوه"
    },
    "fra": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Une vallée près de Salem où Abraham rencontra Melchisédek (Genèse 14.17) ; également connue sous le nom de vallée du roi.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "vallée de Schavé"
    },
    "hau": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Wani kwari kusa da Salem inda Ibrahim ya sadu da Melkisedek (Farawa 14:17); an kuma san shi da Kwarin Sarki.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Kwarin Shabe"
    },
    "hin": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "शालेम के निकट एक तराई जहाँ इब्राहीम की भेंट मेल्कीसेदेक से हुई थी (उत्पत्ति 14:17); इसे राजा की तराई भी कहा जाता है।",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "शावे की तराई"
    },
    "ibo": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Ndagwurugwu dị nso na Selẹm ebe Ebreham zutere Melkizedek (Jenesis 14:17); nke a makwaara dị ka Ndagwurugwu Eze.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Ndagwurugwu Shave"
    },
    "ind": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Sebuah lembah dekat Salem tempat Abraham bertemu Melkisedek (Kejadian 14:17); juga dikenal sebagai Lembah Raja.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Lembah Syawe"
    },
    "nep": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "सालेमनजिकैको एउटा उपत्यका जहाँ अब्राहामले मल्कीसेदेकलाई भेटेका थिए (उत्पत्ति १४:१७); राजाको उपत्यका भनेर पनि चिनिन्छ।",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "शावेको उपत्यका"
    },
    "por": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Um vale próximo a Salém onde Abraão se encontrou com Melquisedeque (Gênesis 14:17); também conhecido como o Vale do Rei.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Vale de Savé"
    },
    "rus": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Долина близ Салима, где Авраам встретил Мелхиседека (Бытие 14:17); также известная как Царская долина.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "долина Шаве"
    },
    "spa": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Un valle cerca de Salem donde Abraham se encontró con Melquisedec (Génesis 14:17); también conocido como el valle del Rey.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Valle de Save"
    },
    "swh": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Bonde karibu na Salemu ambapo Abrahamu alikutana na Melkizedeki (Mwanzo 14:17); pia linajulikana kama Bonde la Mfalme.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Bonde la Shawe"
    },
    "tpi": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Wanpela ples daun klostu long Salem we Abraham i bin bungim Melkisedek (Stat 14:17); ol i save kolim tu olsem Ples Stret Bilong King.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Ples Daun Save"
    },
    "vie": {
      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "Một thung lũng gần Sa-lem nơi Áp-ra-ham gặp Mên-chi-xê-đéc (Sáng Thế Ký 14:17); cũng được gọi là Thung Lũng Của Vua.",
          "source": "acai"
        }
      ],
      "preferred_label": "Thung lũng Sa-ve"
    },
    "zhs": {
      "descriptions": [
